TEXT -176 -120 Left 2 ;Mode 1 conducting sheet + probe. Centre electrode = +5V, four edges = GND.
TEXT -176 -92 Left 2 ;FRAC = probe distance centre->edge (0..1); V(PROBE) = 5*(1-FRAC).
TEXT -176 -64 Left 2 ;MCP6001 = half A of the MCP6002 (unity-gain buffer, Rin huge).
TEXT -176 -36 Left 2 ;18k/33k scales the <=5V probe to <=3.3V at GPIO34. Rpd 10M stops a floating probe.
TEXT 96 200 Left 1 ;10M pull-down
TEXT -176 360 Left 2 !.op
